From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SyzAster Authors <syzaster@asterinas.org>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 10:54:43 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] distro, kernel: fix NixOS image installation and
 set_tid_address

Pin reproducible nixpkgs tarball, ensure loop partition device nodes
exist during NixOS installation, allow ttyS0 serial console, bump
libflate to 2.3.0 to replace yanked core2 crate, and fix
sys_set_tid_address panic when replacing clear_child_tid.
